  "resolvedFindings": [
    {
      "issue": "fresh fixed-executable CIM scan原来将缺ExecutablePath/CommandLine候选转empty过滤，不能证明absence。",
      "disposition": "actual命令输出unknownIdentityCandidates与其IDs；任一缺关键字段即unknown，validator只接受两个数组计数均0。原PS Inspect75460/Discover旧bridge仍只读，无Stop。"
    },
    {
      "issue": "拒绝unknown前若未先保原stdout，实际unknownIDs会丢失。",
      "disposition": "Source02先私有save完整CIM raw，再validate；原Error携带安全ref，总catch的公开failure与私有原error都保该ref。"
    }
  ],
  "necessaryRecoveryConditions": [
    "固定原j9b0、原PG51fbb、sealedHTTP124、APIowner、current snapshot和4public metadata refs的raw长度/SHA；137原私有记录必须唯一、连续00000–00136且逐hash，由Root运行时读取。C只核公开索引/源，没有读私有内容。",
    "先wx原ledger/PG后一次Fixture.open，完整JSON逆revision必须逐字节等原j；旧final report必须不存在。85已有ordinary birth+独立可见、10committed envelope和原9PG event分别核，不能混计。",
    "fresh Linux源exe/Root task Node扫描及原已知PID、五ports、低role app连接/预备事务必须静默；只精确继承systemd/sd-pam两个已知不可读PID/comm hash。原Native start/group缺失保持unknown。",
    "Windows仅复用actual cap/current/mounted同raw原PS f26c；只Inspect75460/Discover旧bridge与固定Node/Chrome rawSHA+CIM只读扫描。前后两phase六个private标签唯一，未知元数据/仍活身份必须停；不借未来budget/driver/runtime，更不发Stop。",
    "current完整107 rowset必须等原sealed124.after；两planned只令facts.unknownCreates=2，不能误称两新行。mutable未知0、原singleton admitted0observations/before==expected及Rust空四键localObjects都严格核。",
    "真实owner验证c01 marker/OID27149并BEGIN READ ONLY/app0/prepared0，完整control.scope/request/case/op与used20精确同原active19；完整live9 events逐字段等原19drained原9，active19不得有新birth。",
    "真实poms DDL/TG_TABLE_SCHEMA、registered function body/definition和34trigger关系闭合schema；不编event.source_schema或不存在的active getter。每event对应原PG committed/independent visibility/xid/xmin/immutable identity，并且既有ordinary owned envelope相同create/commit context。",
    "成熟reconcile只开新private generation接回原active19；显式handle.drainCase必须返回[]，0新证书。只对原两个intentId调用成熟resolveNoCreates，每项返回resolvedWithoutAdoption1，current SELECT完整ID集必须等原beforeIds且已有owned；不adopt/discard/改selector。",
    "成熟handle.restore必须导出原9事件且hash等fresh完整集、footprint等原Rust.before；原journal/active19不回写成当时已drained。",
    "再次双平台/DB静默后只记lateDrain。固定c01Rust唯一setting/key advisory由新PID重获；原成熟CAS归还原7字段/版本/时间、COMMIT/独立可见/实际unlock后，才成熟85/0二次0/0清理。",
    "最终unknown0并完整107 rowset逐值等原initial baseline；任何未知事件、foreign reference、COMMIT不明、close失败或保全失败均保留partial，不能伪恢复成功。只CLI显式退出以断开专用helper连接，不DROP未知对象。"
